# gallery/examples/bar-chart.qmd: the trailing SELECT ... VISUALISE form (1a),
#   LABEL (1b), bar auto-count (1b), PROJECT y, x TO cartesian (Tier 3).
# gallery/examples/histogram.qmd: the trailing SELECT form (1a), LABEL (1b),
